      "description": "The engine every dithercn component uses: threshold matrices with blue noise, a WebGL dither shader, SVG patterns and CSS masks, image dithering, theme colours and motion hooks.",
      "docs": "dithercn's components are examples built on this engine. To have your coding agent build any dither of its own on it, add the agent skill if you haven't: npx shadcn@latest add https://dithercn.dev/r/dithercn-skill.json",
